{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>From the plains of Moab to Mount Nebo.</b> How many stages there were, and Moses strode them all in a single stride (Sotah 13)." "<b>All the land.</b> He showed him all the land of Israel in its tranquility, and the oppressors destined to oppress it." "<b>As far as Dan.</b> He showed him the children of Dan worshipping idolatry, as it says (Judges 18) ״וַיָּקִימוּ לָהֶם בְנֵי דָן אֶת הַפָּסֶל״, and He showed him Samson, who was destined to come forth from it as a deliverer."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:49:56.385008926Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}